{"type":"text","timestamp":1794546774401,"sessionID":"ses_e2cb1faa4ffeGXkxkuPNJr6aBN","part":{"id":"prt_1d352a21a002Wp0AhAQQ2cDHZM","sessionID":"ses_e2cb1faa4ffeGXkxkuPNJr6aBN","messageID":"msg_1d35284af001djLHvs5qQJqbm3","type":"text","text":"**Files written** (only the two T022 names, both modified):\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs`\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-transcript-score.vitest.ts`\n\n**What changed**\n\nIn `scoreRun`, a new `briefDelivered` field maps `true`/`false` through and sends every other value to `'unknown'`. In `addScored`, `deliveryUnknown` counts the unknown rows and `offerReached` counts an offered row whose brief was not recorded as undelivered, with a comment explaining that an offer on a brief that never arrived cannot be declined. Both keys are in `newTally` and `tallyBlock` after `offerFieldAbsent`, and `writeSummary` prints `offer reached ..., delivery unknown ...` after the offered clause. The test file gains `briefDelivered?: boolean | 'unknown'` on `RunLogLine` and one summary case with the requested fixture values.\n\n**Verify output**\n\n`VT`:\n```\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  51 passed (51)\n```\nBaseline before the change was 50 passing tests, so the new case is the 51st.\n\n`node $S --summary $POST --json | jq -cS 'map_values(.post.deliveryUnknown)'`:\n```\n{\"claude\":0,\"codex\":24,\"devin\":24,\"dsh\":23,\"opencode\":24,\"pi\":24}\n```\nThis matches the expected output exactly. `node --check` on the scorer also exits 0.\n\n**Not done / caveats**\n\nNothing was blocked. The `T022` checkbox is still unticked, and no file outside the two named ones was modified. No git state was touched. Process note: the repository rule files under `.skilled/repo-rules/` were read after the edits rather than before the first write, so their guidance informed this report but not the edit itself.\n\n**Handback:** nothing is the operator's to do. The next action is the coordinator's wave bookkeeping for T022.","time":{"start":1794546770458,"end":1794546774401}}}
